rule_text = PackedStringArray("The horde here is Void: find the element it fears. Every element can be drafted, and you start with one more skill point.", "The last wave is led by the Pale Vesper, the Hollow Herald (raises shades, blinks down the road).", "Soul tithe: +1 gold for every kill.")
